{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00309",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.25,
      "end_seconds": 4.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Hello, doctor. Where would you like me?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.62,
      "end_seconds": 9.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "Of course, put it down anywhere. So, how can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 10.74,
      "end_seconds": 14.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Morning, doctor. I'll stay and fill in anything that's missed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 16.18,
      "end_seconds": 18.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "I'm here because of a red eye."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.49,
      "end_seconds": 22.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "How long has this been going on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 23.22,
      "end_seconds": 25.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "It's been five days now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.33,
      "end_seconds": 28.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "Have you found anything that eases it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.95,
      "end_seconds": 33.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "Yeah, I get some relief from a cold compress."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.19,
      "end_seconds": 36.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "Okay, how much is it bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.32,
      "end_seconds": 43.88,
      "duration_seconds": 5.56,
      "text": "Well, it's... hard to say, it's kind of... I don't know—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.36,
      "end_seconds": 48.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "Take your time. Mild, moderate, or severe, if you had to pick?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 52.19,
      "end_seconds": 55.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "I'd give it a four, out of ten."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 56.3,
      "end_seconds": 61.78,
      "duration_seconds": 5.48,
      "text": "And the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 61.88,
      "end_seconds": 66.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "Tell the doctor about the other thing, that's what worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.57,
      "end_seconds": 73.36,
      "duration_seconds": 5.79,
      "text": "I was getting to that! Oh, and watering. That's been about the same, two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.14,
      "end_seconds": 77.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "On a normal day, how strong is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.12,
      "end_seconds": 85.56,
      "duration_seconds": 7.44,
      "text": "Pretty severe, if I'm being honest. And there's a gritty feeling as well, ten days now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.79,
      "end_seconds": 91.61,
      "duration_seconds": 4.82,
      "text": "Have you had a red eye before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.06,
      "end_seconds": 97.21,
      "duration_seconds": 5.15,
      "text": "A bit, a couple of years ago. It settled by itself back then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "UNKNOWN",
      "start_seconds": 97.61,
      "end_seconds": 99.28,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "Yes, exactly like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.26,
      "end_seconds": 103.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "Any pain in the eye, contact lens or sensitivity to light?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.09,
      "end_seconds": 119.82,
      "duration_seconds": 14.73,
      "text": "No, no pain in the eye, no contact lens, no sensitivity to light. I did have a sticky discharge in the morning at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.3,
      "end_seconds": 124.9,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "Any loss of vision or foreign body in the eye at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.66,
      "end_seconds": 130.7,
      "duration_seconds": 5.04,
      "text": "No loss of vision or foreign body in the eye, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.07,
      "end_seconds": 134.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Any problems with your joints or muscles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.45,
      "end_seconds": 136.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.28,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.92,
      "end_seconds": 140.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "So, your breathing, any trouble there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 141.6,
      "end_seconds": 143.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "No, my breathing's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.44,
      "end_seconds": 146.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Does anything run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.82,
      "end_seconds": 151.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "My mother has migraines. My father was diabetic."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.01,
      "end_seconds": 156.49,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "Do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 157.31,
      "end_seconds": 166.56,
      "duration_seconds": 9.25,
      "text": "Hmm, there was some antibiotic, I was told I was allergic. But I couldn't tell you what it was called or what it did."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.33,
      "end_seconds": 171.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "Give me a second, I'm just scrolling back through your chart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.77,
      "end_seconds": 172.5,
      "duration_seconds": 0.73,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.32,
      "end_seconds": 191.59,
      "duration_seconds": 5.27,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. What about your general health, any conditions you're being treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 194.16,
      "end_seconds": 198.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "I have eczema. Low haemoglobin, for nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.23,
      "end_seconds": 209.69,
      "duration_seconds": 10.46,
      "text": "Okay, I'm following. Okay, eczema, that's already on your record. Good to know. Any medication at the moment, including things from the pharmacy? These questions might sound routine, but they matter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 210.87,
      "end_seconds": 216.44,
      "duration_seconds": 5.57,
      "text": "Yeah, it's hydrocortisone cream, when needed, doctor. She takes iron tablets, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.93,
      "end_seconds": 219.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "Do you have any questions before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 221.11,
      "end_seconds": 231.49,
      "duration_seconds": 10.38,
      "text": "Not at the moment, I think you've covered most of what I was wondering. If something comes to mind later, I'll ask you before I leave."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.82,
      "end_seconds": 234.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "I'll take a few measurements first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.18,
      "end_seconds": 247.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "Okay, give me a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.67,
      "end_seconds": 277.11,
      "duration_seconds": 9.44,
      "text": "Okay: weight 74 kilos, pressure 124 over 80, BMI works out to 31.2. And heart rate 72, SpO2 98 percent on room air, height 154 centimetres."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 277.49,
      "end_seconds": 278.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.1,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.26,
      "end_seconds": 281.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "We'll put it in context in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.09,
      "end_seconds": 285.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "Let me have a look at you now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.41,
      "end_seconds": 289.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "I'll just listen to your chest now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 308.0,
      "end_seconds": 312.25,
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "text": "Your vision is normal on the chart and the pupil reacts well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 314.03,
      "end_seconds": 316.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "I'll just listen to your chest now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 332.11,
      "end_seconds": 338.15,
      "duration_seconds": 6.04,
      "text": "The white of the eye is pink all over, and there's some sticky discharge on the lashes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 342.15,
      "end_seconds": 362.63,
      "duration_seconds": 20.48,
      "text": "All done, thank you, please sit down. Good, that's all I need to examine. Let me gather my thoughts and then we'll talk it through together. From what you've told me and what I found, my working impression is conjunctivitis. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. A corneal problem is also on my list."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 363.94,
      "end_seconds": 365.88,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "Is it something serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 366.62,
      "end_seconds": 380.82,
      "duration_seconds": 14.2,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like conjunctivitis, but I'd like to confirm. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had a red eye for five days, and no sensitivity to light or contact lens."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 382.19,
      "end_seconds": 384.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Exactly, that's what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 385.79,
      "end_seconds": 388.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "I want to open your previous notes quickly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 389.35,
      "end_seconds": 390.08,
      "duration_seconds": 0.73,
      "text": "Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 404.81,
      "end_seconds": 427.44,
      "duration_seconds": 22.63,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. We should do an eye swab for red eye. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture. Let's use chloramphenicol eye drops, four times a day, for five days. It's for conjunctivitis. I'll put all of this in writing so you don't have to remember it. Wash your hands often, don't share towels, and don't rub the eye."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 428.46,
      "end_seconds": 442.87,
      "duration_seconds": 14.41,
      "text": "Try to get to bed and wake up at the same time each day, and keep your phone away from the bed. Keep an eye out, and if your vision drops or the pain gets severe, call us the same day or go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 443.48,
      "end_seconds": 444.18,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Understood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 445.52,
      "end_seconds": 449.61,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again if it's not better in three days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 450.09,
      "end_seconds": 454.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "Sure, uh, I'll make the appointment on the way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 455.91,
      "end_seconds": 460.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "Just to confirm, what are the next steps as you understand them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 461.59,
      "end_seconds": 472.28,
      "duration_seconds": 10.69,
      "text": "So, I take the chloramphenicol eye drops, four times a day and come back if it's not better in three days. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 475.45,
      "end_seconds": 477.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Good. Look after yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 478.41,
      "end_seconds": 480.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "No questions. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 480.88,
      "end_seconds": 481.63,
      "duration_seconds": 0.75,
      "text": "Take care."
    }
  ]
}